{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2023-01-31 12:00:00', 'title': 'MULESOFT RECOGNIZED AS A LEADER IN GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT™ FOR INTEGRATION PLATFORM AS A SERVICE, WORLDWIDE (IPAAS)', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO , JAN. 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SALESFORCE [NYSE: CRM], THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GARTNER® NAMED MULESOFT \xa0A LEADER IN THE GARTNER® MAGIC QUADRANT FOR INTEGRATION PLATFORM AS A SERVICE, WORLDWIDE (IPAAS). THIS IS THE EIGHTH TIME THAT MULESOFT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED.'}